+## Shortlist
+### 1. Meridian Lofts — Ravenswood
+
+- Base rent: $2,675
+- Required parking: $0 (the $150 garage space is optional)
+- Compared monthly total: $2,675
+- Available: 2026-09-10; a 12-month lease is offered
+- Weekday 8:30 a.m. transit to Clark/Lake: 22 min
+- Fit: exactly two bedrooms, cats allowed, in-unit laundry, and a balcony
+
+### 2. Birchline Court — Lincoln Square
+
+- Base rent: $2,475
+- Required parking: $125
+- Compared monthly total: $2,600
+- Available: 2026-09-01; a 12-month lease is offered
+- Weekday 8:30 a.m. transit to Clark/Lake: 26 min
+- Fit: exactly two bedrooms, cats allowed, and in-unit laundry; no balcony
+
+### 3. Aster Row — Albany Park
+
+- Base rent: $2,700
+- Required parking: $0
+- Compared monthly total: $2,700
+- Available: 2026-08-28; a 12-month lease is offered
+- Weekday 8:30 a.m. transit to Clark/Lake: 26 min
+- Fit: exactly two bedrooms, cats allowed, and in-unit laundry; no balcony
+
+## Comparison
+
+| Rank | Property | Neighborhood | Base rent | Required parking | Compared total | Available | Transit to Clark/Lake |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | Meridian Lofts | Ravenswood | $2,675 | $0 | $2,675 | 2026-09-10 | 22 min |
+| 2 | Birchline Court | Lincoln Square | $2,475 | $125 | $2,600 | 2026-09-01 | 26 min |
+| 3 | Aster Row | Albany Park | $2,700 | $0 | $2,700 | 2026-08-28 | 26 min |
+
+## Trade-offs
+
+- **Meridian Lofts:** The shortest commute and a balcony lead the ranking, and Ravenswood's quieter blocks and rail choices are appealing; garage parking is optional and excluded from the compared total.
+- **Birchline Court:** Its $2,600 compared total is the lowest of the shortlist, with Lincoln Square's shops and calmer evenings as positives; the $125 parking charge is required and the home has no balcony.
+- **Aster Row:** Albany Park's grocery variety is a plus, but this home has no balcony; after its 26-minute commute and $2,700 compared total tied another qualifying home, the property-name tie-break placed it third.
+
+## Method
+
+I reviewed `listing_snapshots.csv`, `transit_times.csv`, and `neighborhood_notes.md`, all from the packet as of 2026-08-12. I retained listings with exactly two bedrooms, availability on or before 2026-09-15, a 12-month term, cats allowed, in-unit laundry, and a weekday 8:30 a.m. Clark/Lake trip of 30 minutes or less. Compared cost is base rent plus required parking only, excluding optional parking. Qualifying homes were ranked by shortest transit, then lower compared monthly cost, then property name.
